ies":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"Q2mR4I8LdkYE-Tw7_-s-vw","review_id":"uLPcPpi_7zWItK30ZUrFvQ","date":"2017-04-26T17:41:22","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9505972862243652,"text_excerpt":"I kept passing this place up thinking they just sold Hummus. I was pleased to find they have a nice modest menu of Mediterranean fare. More of a lunch spot, they serve platters, sandwiches, salads and other small bites. The most unique part is the complimentary pita bar with an array of dip options and olives. I ordered the Mediterranean chicken pita sandwich. It came with fries (the thick crispy kind) tucked onto the pita opening. The rest of the deliciousness (juicy grilled chicken with nice crisped ends) was stuffed inside with a delightfully fresh tahini. Loved it. It was a little pricier than other but worth the extra dollars. **I went back Tal's this week and tried the Beef Kabob sa..."},{"business_id":"Q2mR4I8LdkYE-Tw7_-s-vw","review_id":"OJ_uSPixIOEi4A-uHQd7aw","date":"2017-08-30T01:47:19","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9466387033462524,"text_excerpt":"I ordered to-go and while waiting enjoyed some dips and pita. I had the sabich (fried eggplant, hard boiled egg) sandwich. The amba, tahini, and pickles put it over the edge. It was delicious I MUST have it again soon! The Tal's hummus was excellent as well. The establishment is a cute little shop on Magazine. It seems like a great place for casual lunches or quick dinners. I'm so excited Tal's is close to my work. I can't wait to visit here more often."},{"business_id":"Q2mR4I8LdkYE-Tw7_-s-vw","review_id":"FHqLlImPSCqR_oS0nx1vFQ","date":"2017-05-10T21:28:00","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9349210262298584,"text_excerpt":"Israeli food as its best. Came to Tal's for the first time today. I felt like I was sitting in a breezy cafe in Tel Aviv. The fried cauliflower and mushroom hummus were delectable. My pita sandwich, the \"Pita Sabich\" was filled with delicious goodness including fried eggplant and tahini. Falafel has the perfect crisp to it. Tons of vegetarian options. Love the variety of sandwiches and dishes to share as well as a large list of specials. So happy for this neighborhood gem!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Q2mR4I8LdkYE-Tw7_-s-vw","photo_id":"kO8vXDsje10etC6se6W6TQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/kO8vXDsje10etC6se6W6TQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8934367895126343},{"business_id":"Q2mR4I8LdkYE-Tw7_-s-vw","photo_id":"ViN8Ycr61fVMQ77-97o4eQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/ViN8Ycr61fVMQ77-97o4eQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8555394411087036},{"business_id":"Q2mR4I8LdkYE-Tw7_-s-vw","photo_id":"cYXvdcBtIOiBpCs8uO4xDw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/cYXvdcBtIOiBpCs8uO4xDw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8520536422729492},{"business_id":"Q2mR4I8LdkYE-Tw7_-s-vw","photo_id":"HOvf6d5aPzVczxP6HeBaDQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/HOvf6d5aPzVczxP6HeBaDQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.771121621131897},{"business_id":"Q2mR4I8LdkYE-Tw7_-s-vw","photo_id":"9-dC6J6wCKDg5D4CF-wuZw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/9-dC6J6wCKDg5D4CF-wuZw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7708820700645447}]},"notebook_case":null}
